# /sdd-restore

Description:
  Restore .sdd/ files from a previous backup. Requires approval.

Usage:
  /sdd-restore --latest
  /sdd-restore --backup=<name>
  /sdd-restore --list

Options:
  --latest   Restore from latest backup
  --backup   Restore from specific backup
  --list     List available backups

Process:
  1. Verify backup integrity
  2. Backup current state
  3. Restore files
  4. Verify restored files

Safety:
  Current state is backed up before restore.
  Human confirmation required.

Exit Codes:
  0 - Success
  1 - Failed
  2 - Backup not found
  3 - Backup corrupted

State: +
